''' Hindustan National Glass & Industries Limited ''' ('''HNGIL''') is an Indian container glassmaker based in [[Mumbai]]. The company is the largest and one of the oldest glass manufacturing companies in India.{{Citation needed|date=March 2020}}

==History==
Hindustan National Glass & Industries Limited is engaged in manufacturing and selling of container glass.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.business-standard.com/article/markets/hindustan-national-glass-zooms-53-in-three-days-on-debt-resolution-plan-118083000254_1.html|title=Hindustan National Glass zooms 53% in three days on debt resolution plan|first=S. I.|last=Reporter|date=30 August 2018|publisher=|via=Business Standard}}</ref> The company was originally incorporated on 23 February, under the name of "Hindustan National Glass Manufacturing Company Limited". On 22 November 1971 the name was changed to the present one. In 2018, it is reported to have barely escaped bankruptcy.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.dnaindia.com/business/report-hindusthan-national-glass-industries-to-repay-rs-2000-cr-in-nick-of-time-escape-nclt-2656180|title=Hindusthan National Glass & Industries to repay Rs 2,000 cr in nick of time, escape NCLT|date=29 August 2018|website=DNA India}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/news/hind-glass-gets-90-days-more-to-settle-debt/article25734776.ece|title=Hind Glass gets 90 days more to settle debt|first=Abhishek|last=Law|website=thehindubusinessline.com|date=13 December 2018 }}</ref>

In September 2025, it was announced that the firm was acquired by Independent Sugar Corporation Limited (also known as INSCO), part of the [[Uganda]]-based [[Madhvani Group]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.entrepreneur.com/en-in/news-and-trends/madhvani-groups-insco-completes-inr-2250-cr-acquisition/497679|title= Madhvani Group's INSCO Completes INR 2,250 Cr Acquisition of HNGIL|work=Entrepreneur India|access-date=2025-10-01|language=en}}</ref>

== Products ==
HNGIL manufactures containers for pharmaceuticals, liquor, beer, beverages, cosmetics and processed food.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://in.reuters.com/finance/stocks/company-profile/HNGI.BO|title=Company Profile for ${Instrument_CompanyName}|work=Reuters|language=en}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.indiainfoline.comcompany/hindusthan-national-glass-industries-ltd/summary/4640|title=Latest Hindusthan national glass industries ltd information at www.indiainfoline.com|website=indiainfoline.comcompany}}</ref>

